42         is integer
&hFF       is integer
2.5        is float64
1e6        is float64

42L        is int32
42LL       is int64
42U        is uinteger
42UL       is uint32
42ULL      is uint64
2.5F       is float32
2.5D       is float64

3000000000 is uinteger
